# DS-0002: web/Dockerfile builds on the official Caddy image, which runs as
# root so it can bind 80/443. TLS terminates there; no application code runs
# as root in this container. Re-review: 2027-05-10.
DS-0002

# CVE-2026-78661: golang.org/x/net v0.60.0 is linked into the upstream
# caddy:2-alpine binary (latest release v2.11.9 still pins it; the fix ships in
# x/net v0.62.0). The Caddyfile serves static files, redirects HTTP, and proxies
# /api, /healthz, and /readyz; it enables no templates directive and parses no
# request bodies as HTML, so the x/net/html denial of service is not reachable
# in this deployment. Re-review: 2026-12-12, and remove once Caddy ships
# golang.org/x/net >= v0.62.0.
CVE-2026-78661
